    "program": "# Draw a kinematic seam on workpiece, join its touching extension, then carry both.\n# JOIN is a scene-parenting event; it does not simulate melting or bond strength.\nROBOT seam_cartesian\nTOOL tcp_link\nPOSE seam_start world 0.15 0 0 Q 0 0 0 1\nPOSE via world 0.35 0.14 0 Q 0 0 0 1\nPOSE arc_end world 0.55 0 0 Q 0 0 0 1\nPOSE seam_end world 0.65 0.12 0 Q 0 0 0 1\nPOSE carry_end world 0.30 -0.12 0 Q 0 0 0 1\nMOVEJ seam_start\nWELD ON workpiece\nMOVEC via arc_end\nMOVEL seam_end\nWELD OFF\nWELD JOIN extension_plate workpiece\nPAUSE 0.2\nGRAB workpiece\nMOVEL carry_end\nRELEASE workpiece\n"
  },
